  "definition": "Provider Participation",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-11-27",
  "historyNote": "#10655, INTERIM, eff 8-15-14, EXPIRES: 2-11-15; ss by #10779, eff 2-11-15; ss by #10922, eff 9-1-15; ss by #11107, eff 7-1-16; amd by #12131, eff 3-10-17; ss by #12681, eff 11-27-18",
